      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "strokeColor": "#862e9c",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3079,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3086,
      "text": "Temporal retries handle_elicitation\n\u2192 fresh tasks/result call \u2192 new connection\n\u2192 server re-elicits (still PENDING-APPROVAL)\n\u2192 handler signals wf (idempotent)\n\u2192 polls get_pending_decision\n\nIf human already responded between retries:\n\u2192 query returns decision immediately\n\u2192 activity completes in one poll cycle\n\nRetry policy IS the connection lifecycle.",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Temporal retries handle_elicitation\n\u2192 fresh tasks/result call \u2192 new connection\n\u2192 server re-elicits (still PENDING-APPROVAL)\n\u2192 handler signals wf (idempotent)\n\u2192 polls get_pending_decision\n\nIf human already responded between retries:\n\u2192 query returns decision immediately\n\u2192 activity completes in one poll cycle\n\nRetry policy IS the connection lifecycle.",
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
