      "width": 652,
      "height": 114,
      "text": "handler runs... polls get_pending_decision every 0.5s\n  query 1: None  \u2192  sleep 0.5s\n  query 2: None  \u2192  sleep 0.5s\n  query 3: None  \u2192  sleep 0.5s\n  ...  (user takes 3 minutes to decide)\n  reader loop CANNOT advance",
